  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting climate adaptation and resilience through innovation and entrepreneurship for green jobs in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Malawi Child Project is to reduce climate vulnerability and enhance the resilience of vulnerable communities by promoting innovation, facilitating technology transfer, and deploying adaptation and resilience-building solutions at scale through the private sector. The project will be transformative by establishing a functional adaptation market in Malawi, positioning MSMEs as drivers of locally led adaptation, and enabling the adoption of inclusive, gender-responsive solutions that deliver long-term impact. By addressing structural barriers and mobilising private-sector investment, the project will shift adaptation from isolated interventions to a systemic, market-based approach.</narrative>
  </description>
